//! Desktop Home Hub (`Page::Home` · 首页).
//!
//! Work-first home: sourced matters and reviews, resumable tasks and recorded outputs.
//! Device dashboards below are only constructed after the user expands the tools:
//! Legacy dashboard includes:
//! - 今日脉搏 hero: a 24-hour SVG day dial (calendar arcs, alarms, night band, now-hand),
//!   the scene + natural-language omnibox, the **phone Amoo briefing** (genuine suggestions
//!   generated by the connected phone's AI from Home's live context, falling back to local
//!   rules with an explicit label), and 2×2 SVG KPI ring gauges.
//! - A native day timeline (06–24h) with event blocks, alarm pins and a now marker.
//! - IM direct reply master-detail, OTP/pickup tickets with logistics steppers, the week
//!   calendar + work deliverables, alarms / pomodoro / control-center switches.
//! - An SVG app-usage donut and the live phone + BackScreen LED studio.
//!
//! Fixed charts use `stepx_companion::home_visuals` and `Companion::svg_canvas`.
//! Responsive timelines, week bars and flow markers use native layout and painting;
//! all labels stay native text.

